{"_meta":{"com.oxinsider/docs-group":"traders","securitySchemes":[{"scopes":["read"],"type":"oauth2"}]},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get trader category records"},"description":"One wallet's win record in every canonical category it has a settled market in: wins, decided (wins plus losses) and win_rate per category, busiest first. The Esports record also lists each esports game it has a settled market in. The basis is every settled market at any size, so it differs from get_trader's categories expansion, which applies a 20 USD notional floor and an entry-price rule; neither corrects the other. A category with fewer decided markets than min_decided_for_win_rate keeps its counts with win_rate null and status not_enough_data. An absent category means no record, never a 0% record.\n\nArgs:\n  - address (string, required): Wallet address (0x...), username, or trd_-prefixed trader id\n  - category (string, optional): One canonical category through the shared rollup: soccer and EPL reach Soccer, every esports label reaches Esports, football is American football. A game is not a filter: ask for esports and read games\n\nReturns: records, min_decided_for_win_rate, basis, computed_at and meta. A trader with no settled market returns empty records; an unknown address is a not_found error.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"address":{"description":"Wallet address (0x...), username, or trd_-prefixed trader id","maxLength":100,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"category":{"description":"One canonical category through the shared rollup: soccer and EPL reach Soccer, every esports label reaches Esports, football is American football. A value matching no record returns empty records","minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["address"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_trader_categories","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"ResponseMeta":{"properties":{"cache_age_s":{"type":"integer"},"cached":